'CR3000 TA54
'
'Title:  TA54-V10-1.CR3  08/21/2023 Updated
'
'
'###################################################################################
'########## Program Comments #######################################################
'###################################################################################
' 
'
'
'Date:  21 August 2023 Program Update to Version V10-1.
'Updated for Barometric Pressure the Stair Stepping at 800mb; update of 2016missed
'the minimum reading measurement category.
'
'
'Date: 1 March 2023 Program Update to  Version 10.
'Changed out Eppley Sensors and associated multiplers
' LWDN was 3.32, new multiplier 3.69 SN-28523F3
' LWUP was 2.81, new multiplier 3.71 SN-28125F3
' SWUP was 10.45, new multiplier 7.61 SN-27759
' SWDN was 8.52, new multiplier 9.58 SN-29208
'
'
' Date:  April 14, 2022 Version update changed to TA54_V9_1; GTStanton
'Changed out Temp Sensors from model 060A2 to 061 MetOne requiring change to the
'Multiplier & Offset;  new multi: -147.0588, new offset: 95.7353.
'
'
'Date March 17, 2021  Program Version Change to TA54_V9; GTStanton
'Changed Out Eppley Sensor SN-23161 with Sensor SN-25412.
'SWUP SN-23161 was 10.45 multiplier.
'SWUP SN-25412 new 7.86 multiplier.
'
'
'Date July 7, 2020,
'New Program:  TA54_V8_2.CR3
'Old Program:  TA54-V8_1.CR3
' Changed Out Eppley Sensors, thus updated multiplers.
' LWDN was 3.95, new multiplier 3.32
' LWUP was 3.75, new multiplier 2.81
' SWUP was 7.61, new multiplier 10.45
' SWDN was 10.78, new multiplier 8.52
'
'
'
' Date: Jan 25, 2019
'New Program:  TA54_V8_1.CR3
'Old Program:  TA54_V8.CR3
'D. Bruggeman updated reference for Midnite Air Temp modified on 1/25/19 
' to change the midnight air temperature from RotronAirT_DegC to AirTemp1_AVGDegC
' midnight temperature should be measured from level 0 temperature
'
'
'Date: Jan 26, 2018
' New Program: TA54_V8.CR3
' Old Program: TA54_V7.CR3
'
'Version:7   14 March 2018 Jason Ritter (JCR), Campbell Scientific
'Updated program to version 7, adding the following Public variables
'Midnt_air_temp_C - midnight 15 minute temperature at level 0
'Midnt_RH - midnight relative humidity reading
'===========================================================================
'Version:6   26 January 2018 Jason Ritter (JCR), Campbell Scientific
'Updated program to version 6, adding the following Public variables
'PrecipToday - Precipitation since midnight, updated every 15 minutes
'MaxGustToday - Maximum wind gust since midnight (speed at level 1 only), updated every 15 minutes
'WindChill_C - Wind chill at level 1 only, deg C, updated every 15 minutes, calculated with:
'              WindChill = 35.74 + (0.6215*temp0) - (35.75*speed1^0.16) + (0.4275*temp0*speed1^0.16)
'              with speed1 in mph and temp0 in deg F
'              Then WindChill_C = (WindChill -32)/1.8
'SigmaPhi &
'SigmaTheta-stability at level 1 only, nighttime shortwave down measurement <6 W/m2
'
'
'===========================================================================

'
'
'03-20-17 updated program to ver. 5.1, correcting incorrect eppley sensor multipler entry of 11-09-16.
'SWUP & SWDN multipliers were switched at entry.  SWDN was entered as 7.61 instead of 10.78 etc.
'Const PSP1Cal=10.78  ' Enter PSP1Cal(SWDN) = Eppley Sensitivity Cal Constant in microVolt/WM^2
'Const PSP2Cal=7.61  ' Enter PSP2Cal(SWUP) = Eppley Sensitivity Cal Constant in microVolt/WM^2
'Const LWDNCal=3.95  ' Enter LWDNCal(LWDN) = Eppley Sensitivity Cal Constant in microVolt/WM^2
'Const LWUPCal=3.75  ' Enter LWUPCal(LWUP) = Eppley Sensitivity Cal Constant in microVolt/WM^2
'
'
'
'
' (V-5)11-09-2016 Updated program to Version-5 for New Eppley Sensor Multipliers
' LWDN was 3.30, new multiplier 3.95
' LWUP was 4.09, new multiplier 3.75
' SWUP was 10.55, new multiplier 7.61
' SWDN sensor not changed at this time still within cal period.
' Also added 20ms to BRHalf Air Temp Meas Settling Time gts.
'
'
' 03-10-2016 Updated program lines 340 & 443 to IEEE4 from FP2
' for the Barometric Pressure Resolutions to remove stair-stepping in graphs. GTS
'
''
' Deployed Program Versions
'Version: 4 August 17, 2015 - Jacob Davis, CSI
'    Wholesale renaming of solar radiation variables.
'     As they were called      	New Label       	Indicates
'     EppPSP1	 (Faces Up)       SWDN	     Short Wave Down/Incoming
'     EppPSP2	 (Faces Dwn)      SWUP	     Short Wave Up/Outgoing/Return
'     PIR1	   (Faces Up)       LWDN	      Long Wave Down/Incoming
'     PIR2	  (Faces Dwn)       LWUP	      Long Wave Up/Outgoing/Return
'
'
'Version: 3  Date:  June 6, 2015 (GTS)
'Updated constant of LWDN sensor which was replaced due to connector damage on 06/04/15.
'Started work on Rearrange column order for data table outputs to match previous CR7X output table formats.
' Updating Solar Sensor Call Outs with additon of LWDN & LWUP, SWDN, SWUP nomenclature.
'
'
'
'
'
' Version: 2  Date:  May 14, 2015 (GTS)
' Incorporated all updates & corrections up to this point into the program for initial data comparison testing.
' Updated Constants for installed PSP1(SWDN), PSP2(SWUP), PIR1(LWDN), & PIR2(LWUP) Eppley Solar Sensors.
' Corrected Multipler for determining MJ/m2; changed from 100,000 to 1,000,000.
' Updated Vertical Wind Speed Sensor Multipliers to include the 1.25 Cosine Effect Factor = 0.0225, was = 0.018(Lines 562-570)
' Added to 24Hr Data Output Table the 24Hr Max,Min,Avg for MP101A Rotronics RH.(Lines 426-428).
'
'
